  "name": "ERS-1, ERS-2, RADARSAT Synthetic Aperture Images of Bering Sea",
  "description": "ERS-1, ERS-2, RADARSAT Synthetic aperture images of Bering Sea.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Mesoscale ocean features, such as eddies, fronts, internal waves, wind streaks, surface films and ship wakes. Also ice edge, ice flow and polynya observations",
